{"bookId":"cp-2","editionId":"6879da4e6ec271ab","chapterId":"c0177","paragraphs":[{"id":"p198d64e646c0-1","text":"把酒祝东风。"},{"id":"p4aa4f68bfc50-1","text":"且共从容。"},{"id":"p28d6392b02f4-1","text":"垂杨紫陌洛城东。"},{"id":"pf223c020107b-1","text":"总是当时携手处，游遍芳丛。"},{"id":"p5fdb4337fb06-1","text":"聚散苦匆匆。"},{"id":"p9b3f8963f01a-1","text":"此恨无穷。"},{"id":"p21e42aad683a-1","text":"今年花胜去年红。"},{"id":"p1c036d213fd1-1","text":"可惜明年花更好，知与谁同。"}]}